            "headline": "Questions About Avanta",
            "body": "Answers to common inquiries about our platform, security, and onboarding.",
            "faqs": [
              {
                "q": "How fast can I set up an account?",
                "a": "Most businesses are onboarded within minutes using our automated KYC and KYB checks. For larger enterprises, our team can help guide you through advanced setup."
              },
              {
                "q": "Is Avanta available globally?",
                "a": "Yes, we support clients from over 70 countries and continue to expand our coverage and supported currencies."
              },
              {
                "q": "How secure is my data?",
                "a": "We use industry-standard encryption, continuous monitoring, and undergo regular security audits to ensure your data and funds are safe."
              },
              {
                "q": "What is the cost per transaction?",
                "a": "Transaction fees depend on your plan and volume. Full pricing is transparent and available in your dashboard or by contacting our team."
              },
              {
                "q": "Can I integrate Avanta with my existing tools?",
                "a": "Absolutely. Avanta offers a well-documented API and easy integrations for your business workflows."
              }
